1 2 [c] The iTrust2 Admin has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system UC3.
2 3 [s] admin An Admin enters a user name, a password, confirm password, the role, and if the user is enabled (or active) in the system. The Admin presses the button to add the user . The user name serves as the User's Medical ID (MID). The possible roles are: Patient Health Care Provider (HCP) Admin
3 4 [e] system displays a success message and logs transaction
4 5 [c] A success message is displayed and the action is logged.
